# Barreletics lock scan (sitewide)

Locks live in `planning/locks/`:
- `sitewide.lock.json` — design system (pads, 50/50 mobile, cream, media QC, guarantee, Type OS pointers)
- `<page>.lock.json` — page spine / titles / feature sets

Before push or when refining any page:

1. `python3 scripts/lock-scan.py` from Design Review root
2. Fix every `FAIL` — never edit the lock to green the scan unless Andrew re-locks
3. Report FAIL lines only (coffee blurts)
4. One axis at a time after scan is clean

Media geometry failures are not code bugs — run media QC gate before FIT/Liquid thrash.
